# EduPlay Selector — Strict Requirements

Read `REQUIREMENTS.md` for full detail. These rules are mandatory on every change.

## Product
- K–12 educator tool (**EduPlay Selector**), not a hobbyist BGG catalog
- Two views only: **Game Selector** + **Inspiration** (global sticky navbar always visible)

## Data (`gamesData.js`)
Required fields: `id`, `name`, `subjects[]`, `softSkills[]`, `pedagogicalTrait`, `researchNote`, `players`, `duration`, `bggId`
- `bggId` = cover image lookup only
- **Never add or display `bggScore`** — remove if present
- No BGG weight/rank/mechanism/theme fields unless explicitly approved
- as i add information in game data, make sure to update all the time to game selector UI

## Game Selector UI
- Card tagline = `pedagogicalTrait`
- Meta = `players` + `duration` only
- Tags = about 2 subjects + 2 soft skills
- Filters = players, time, subjects, soft skills, min age
- Card tags include `minAge` pill (e.g. 8+); `targetStages` shown only in bottom Targets line
- **No BGG scores, ratings, ranks, or weight badges in UI**
- never volunteerly delete text from gameData.js unless I @ it

## Inspiration page
- Keep all in-text citations intact
- Bold: **Reveal-and-React**, **Inhibitory Control**, **Microworlds**
- Semantic `<article>` / `<section>` structure; responsive

## Design (`design.md`)
- Pill-shaped controls, rounded-3xl cards, warm OKLCH palette, ambient blur background

## Technical
- Hash router: `#/` and `#/inspiration`
- Never commit `BGG_API_TOKEN`
